# Manifold level 10
# The wall's yard (stage 5h): the first level, at half past four. The defender at its south end, behind
# low cover, a bolt and a shotgun on their racks; the attackers come in through the gate in the wall at
# its north end, three waves, each keeping to a way in (west, middle, east) until it sees the defender.
# An ambient of 0.45: torches round the yard, everyone is seen (a guard sees what is lit with 0.3).
title The yard
spawn 0 1 7
facing 0 0 -1
ambient 0.45
sky 4.5

